# Every text file in this tree is LF, and a CRLF file here is not a cosmetic problem.
#
# Tests parse Markdown line by line with regexes anchored by `$`, and in JavaScript `.` does
# not match `\r`, so a CRLF rewrite makes them silently match nothing. It reached this repo
# once through an editing tool writing files back in Python text mode on Windows. Normalising
# here means it cannot be committed again regardless of which tool does the writing.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binaries, so nothing tries to normalise inside them.
*.png binary
*.pptx binary
*.docx binary
*.xlsx binary
